---
/**
 * Home "Our Approach": red band with the four steps over the pluckable strings.
 *
 * The rows are plain <div>s, not buttons: every panel is open at once, so a row
 * had nothing to reveal, and its only effect was to move a white highlight onto
 * the number: which read as a control that did not do anything.
 */
---

<section class="section approach-band">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow approach__eyebrow reveal">Our Approach</p>
    <div class="approach2 reveal" data-approach>
      <ol class="astep">
        <li class="astep__item" data-astep="0">
          <div class="astep__row">
            <span class="astep__num">1</span>
            <span class="astep__title">We Understand</span>
          </div>
          <div class="astep__panel"><div class="astep__panel-in">
            <p class="astep__desc">We start by finding out what is really going on behind a challenge. Through <strong>research, data collection, monitoring and evaluation, GIS mapping, and analytics</strong>, we gather the evidence you need to make informed decisions.</p>
          </div></div>
        </li>
        <li class="astep__item" data-astep="1">
          <div class="astep__row">
            <span class="astep__num">2</span>
            <span class="astep__title">We Design</span>
          </div>
          <div class="astep__panel"><div class="astep__panel-in">
            <p class="astep__desc">Insights become stories, strategies, and experiences. We make <strong>brands, communication systems, campaigns, publications, and narratives</strong> that make complex things simple, build trust, and bring people together around a shared vision.</p>
          </div></div>
        </li>
        <li class="astep__item" data-astep="2">
          <div class="astep__row">
            <span class="astep__num">3</span>
            <span class="astep__title">We Build</span>
          </div>
          <div class="astep__panel"><div class="astep__panel-in">
            <p class="astep__desc">Ideas only count when they work in the real world. We build <strong>websites, dashboards, SaaS products, AI tools, and digital platforms</strong> that turn strategy into practical tools people can use, and that grow with you.</p>
          </div></div>
        </li>
        <li class="astep__item" data-astep="3">
          <div class="astep__row">
            <span class="astep__num">4</span>
            <span class="astep__title">Grow Together</span>
          </div>
          <div class="astep__panel"><div class="astep__panel-in">
            <p class="astep__desc">Growth is not just about being seen. It is about results. Through <strong>outreach, social media, lead generation, capacity building, and community engagement</strong>, we help you <strong>raise awareness, generate qualified leads,</strong> and build <strong>lasting paths to revenue and impact.</strong></p>
          </div></div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
